Plan B: Codex Relay
Original project: https://github.com/gronxb/codex-relay
Imported working tree based on commit 2a0cca2eaa76d1bd16f8cfe54b892090e6a8bbee.
Copyright 2026 Codex Relay contributors
Licensed under Apache-2.0; see plan-b/LICENSE and plan-b/TRADEMARKS.md.
This fork modifies Android deployment and connection profiles, keyboard/native
compatibility, message rendering, history and session pagination, subagent
grouping, and shared-runtime message/request routing. Modified upstream source
files carry a Codex Anywhere change notice. New files implement these additions.
Upstream hosted OTA deployment records and cloud publishing configurations
are omitted; the Plan B local Android build disables upstream OTA updates.

